name gender
category Package
revision 36464
shortdesc Gender neutrality for languages with grammatical gender
relocated 1
longdesc Many languages -- like German or French -- use masculine and
longdesc feminine grammatical genders. There are many ideas how to
longdesc promote gender neutrality in those languages. The gender
longdesc package uses alternately masculine and feminine forms. It is
longdesc also possible to use just one form out of a template.
runfiles size=2
